    - Derive public `url` from `AWS_URL` with fallback to `{endpoint}/{bucket}`
    - Source `key`/`secret` from `AWS_*` with `MINIO_ACCESS_KEY`/`MINIO_SECRET_KEY` fallback; default `region` `us-east-1`
